            </note>
            <note corresp="#d24-f2" n="2" xml:id="d24-f2-content">
                <p>Telegram 893, May 28, noted that a new policy on the Middle East was being
                    considered and asked for comments on the major problems in the area and
                    additional programs that might contribute to their solution. (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Ibid.,</hi> 611.80/5–2858)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
